supralinux-defaults (1.1.1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Add an exact-path AppArmor profile for Mozilla's Firefox .deb. The
    Ubuntu 26.04 firefox profile pattern does not attach to
    /usr/lib/firefox, which disables user namespaces in the content sandbox
    under kernel.apparmor_restrict_unprivileged_userns=1.
  * Disable obexd's PBAP plugin. evolution-data-server is intentionally not
    installed, so PBAP contact sync is a documented limitation and obexd
    should not log failed EDS activation at every login.

