 -- SupraLINUX Project <packages@supralinux.invalid>  Sat, 07 Nov 2026 11:00:00 -0300

supralinux-defaults (1.0.10) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Keep the Plymouth shutdown console readable: systemd 259 prints the unit
    name in bold in the combined status format, and Plymouth's hidden console
    lacks the bold font at shutdown (Ubuntu #2109459), rendering tofu boxes.
    Use StatusUnitFormat=description.
  * Cap cups-browsed stop at 10 s; it otherwise waits the full 90 s default
    TimeoutStopSec before systemd kills it.

 -- SupraLINUX Project <packages@supralinux.invalid>  Sat, 07 Nov 2026 06:10:00 -0300

supralinux-defaults (1.0.9) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Provision KWallet before Chrome's first run:
    - autologin without LUKS gets a blank Blowfish kdewallet, copied into the
      new user's home by Calamares; the user can set a password later;
    - password login keeps a wallet protected by the user password;
    - autologin with LUKS receives the disk key through pam_systemd_loadkey
      and pam_kwallet5.
  * Point pam_kwallet5 at Plasma 6's ksecretd and add the SDDM
    KeyringMode=inherit drop-in.
  * Keep the wallet creation dialog as a fallback; the normal cases no longer
    depend on it.

