 -- SupraLINUX Project <packages@supralinux.invalid>  Thu, 05 Nov 2026 13:30:00 -0300

supralinux-defaults (1.0.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Avoid regenerating every locale twice during installation.  The
    language packs add a list of Spanish locales and a full locale-gen
    run can exceed the previous Calamares timeout on slow hardware.
    Use locale-gen --keep-existing after localecfg, which is fast when
    the selected locale is already present.
  * Raise the shellprocess timeout to 900 seconds as a safety margin.

